{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cTable Battle Simulator\u201d is a game where you can earn money by selling surprise figure boxes. Open mysterious boxes to collect rare and legendary warrior figures. Use these figures to expand your collection and participate in table battles with people around town. In this world full of strategy, excitement, and action, defeat your opponents to become the strongest collector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039080/extras/f774860d608f99f5e773f97e12992bf0.avif?t=1760523566\" width=620 height=240 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and sell different figure series. Each series has different figure warriors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039080/extras/656580ac5fe187cc9b4223e2a9f172f4.avif?t=1760523566\" width=620 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up battle tables in your store, offer players the opportunity to battle at tables, and earn money from these battles. You can join the battles too! Build your collection and join the battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039080/extras/8146aa3b2946f9996167bbb930163cfa.avif?t=1760523566\" width=620 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Display your figures on shelves, set their prices, and sell them to collectors. If you wish, keep rare pieces to complete your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own figure store. Unlock figure series, order surprise boxes, and sell them by placing them on your shelves. Choose a unique name for your store. Create the perfect store for collectors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039080/extras/1b072d3827e661ca105cff56450cc516.avif?t=1760523566\" width=620 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your collection with rare and valuable warrior figures from surprise boxes. You can earn money by selling these figures or complete your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039080/extras/4a59a021aa8371a5c9e32b2bd1186e34.avif?t=1760523566\" width=620 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your store and attract more customers! Gain new customers and increase your profits with new shelves, race platforms, and figure boxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cTable Battle Simulator\u201d offers you a collecting experience, legendary warrior figures, strategic tabletop battles, and an exciting adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039080?t=1760523566","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039080?t=1760523566","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039080/b8e539d54efa218436c866e69d8210e63424be06/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760523566","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039080/b8e539d54efa218436c866e69d8210e63424be06/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760523566",